<BaseLayout title="About — Search Data Bench" description="About Search Data Bench and its evidence-led research model.">
<section class="prose"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>About Search Data Bench</h1><p class="lede">Search Data Bench publishes independent benchmarks and buyer research for search data, SEO APIs, SERP APIs and AI search intelligence tools.</p><p>Our focus is reproducible evidence: fixed inputs, retained missing results, dated observations and clear separation between direct testing and vendor documentation.</p><p>We do not publish synthetic winner scores simply to make comparisons look cleaner than the underlying evidence.</p></section>
